/* h_8EF1_nw (X<0,Y<0): $31=$FF,$2F=$FF; corner box; fallback ->8BF9(up)/8BC4(left). */
/* h_8FC1_sw (X<0,Y>0): $31=0,$2F=$FF; corner box; fallback ->8D11(down)/8BC4(left). */
